  "description": "TIYJET crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C104 H84 Ho4 N12 O22,2(C2 H3 N1). From the CIF bond table, Ho1 (Ho) has 7 O neighbors; Ho2 (Ho) has 6 O neighbors; Ho3 (Ho) has 7 O neighbors; Ho4 (Ho) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.530-3.804 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 95.12-110.93°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C108H90N14O22Ho4. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
